<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus to offer up to 30 mln in 91 day t-bills.</title>
<headline>Cyprus to offer up to 30 mln in 91 day t-bills.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bank of Cyprus  will offer up to 30 million pounds 91 day treasury bills for February 12 issue, the bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Bids can be made from February 10 to February 12 at 9.00 local time (0700 GMT).</p>
<p>Treasury bill auctions are held twice a month. </p>
<p>($= 0.49 pounds) -- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
